    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "its not just a feeling though. it's how my life actually is. i watch them struggle and i see the exhaustion in their eyes because of me. it feels like the most selfless thing i could do is just... stop being a problem for them. like, if i wasn't here, all that energy they spend on me just goes back to them. it's the only way to actually fix it.",
